WEBVTT

00:00:04.641 --> 00:00:06.504
At the heart of Copilot’s capabilities

00:00:06.504 --> 00:00:10.960
lies Natural Language Processing (or NLP).

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.360
This feature enables Copilot to understand and respond to

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.832
human language as naturally as you or I would.

00:00:18.832 --> 00:00:21.440
You can try giving it intuitive commands like:

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.016
“Summarize today’s meeting notes.” “Draft an email response

00:00:25.016 --> 00:00:28.692
based on the attached feedback. ”or“ Find trends

00:00:28.692 --> 00:00:30.880
in last quarter’s sales data.”

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.180
Do this and sit back and watch as

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.268
Copilot delivers results tailored to your needs.

00:00:38.268 --> 00:00:40.236
Its standout feature is its ability to

00:00:40.236 --> 00:00:44.708
create high-quality content efficiently. Integrating Copilot

00:00:44.708 --> 00:00:48.228
into Microsoft 365 tools like Word, Excel,

00:00:48.228 --> 00:00:52.400
PowerPoint, Teams, and Outlook transforms them into

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:57.130
AI-powered assistants that simplify workflows.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:00.242
Let’s delve deeper into this. With Word,

00:01:00.242 --> 00:01:02.946
Copilot can act as a writing assistant,

00:01:02.946 --> 00:01:06.514
by helping draft documents, summarizing lengthy text,

00:01:06.514 --> 00:01:09.630
or rewriting sections for clarity and impact.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.962
Do you need to write an article,

00:01:11.962 --> 00:01:14.578
a blog post, or a proposal?

00:01:14.578 --> 00:01:18.074
Copilot can craft a first draft based on your prompts.

00:01:18.074 --> 00:01:21.156
For instance, you can ask it to “Create a

00:01:21.156 --> 00:01:24.756
two-page project proposal for a new marketing campaign,”

00:01:24.756 --> 00:01:29.060
and it generates a structured and professional draft.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.764
Also, when you’re tired of sifting through long

00:01:31.764 --> 00:01:35.548
reports or research papers, turn to Copilot.

00:01:35.548 --> 00:01:39.788
It condenses them into concise summaries, allowing

00:01:39.788 --> 00:01:41.840
you to focus on the key takeaways.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:45.196
It can also rewrite sentences or paragraphs

00:01:45.196 --> 00:01:48.638
to improve clarity, tone, or style.

00:01:48.638 --> 00:01:51.526
For example, you might ask, “Make this

00:01:51.526 --> 00:01:54.958
paragraph more conversational” or “Simplify this section

00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:58.142
for an audience unfamiliar with financial jargon.”

00:01:58.142 --> 00:02:00.206
This is particularly useful for editing

00:02:00.206 --> 00:02:03.278
emails, reports, or complex instructions.

00:02:03.278 --> 00:02:05.102
Now, let’s look at how Copilot

00:02:05.102 --> 00:02:07.770
can simplify Excel for you.

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:10.494
Copilot can analyze datasets

00:02:10.494 --> 00:02:12.622
to uncover insights and trends.

00:02:12.622 --> 00:02:15.646
For example, a prompt like “Identify the

00:02:15.646 --> 00:02:18.094
top-performing regions for sales in Q3”

00:02:18.094 --> 00:02:22.590
generates clear insights, complete with visualizations.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:23.790
And if you’re struggling with

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.806
formulas, look no further,

00:02:25.806 --> 00:02:27.702
Copilot can suggest the appropriate

00:02:27.702 --> 00:02:29.550
functions based on your needs.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:32.110
You can say, “Calculate the year-over-

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.966
year growth for these sales figures,” and

00:02:33.966 --> 00:02:36.630
it will apply the correct formula.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:39.206
And finally, save time by automating

00:02:39.206 --> 00:02:42.376
tasks like formatting tables, sorting data,

00:02:42.376 --> 00:02:44.760
or cleaning up inconsistencies.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.240
A simple command such as “Format this data

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.992
for presentation” ensures a polished result without manual

00:02:50.992 --> 00:02:56.472
adjustments. On Powerpoint, Copilot can do so many

00:02:56.472 --> 00:02:58.768
things, from helping you choose the right themes

00:02:58.768 --> 00:03:01.568
and designs to align with your presentation’s tone,

00:03:01.568 --> 00:03:04.888
to transforming text outlines or bullet points into

00:03:04.888 --> 00:03:06.878
well-structured slides.

00:03:06.878 --> 00:03:09.934
For instance, “Create a three-slide presentation

00:03:09.934 --> 00:03:12.646
summarizing this document” results in

00:03:12.646 --> 00:03:15.470
organized, visually appealing slides.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:19.686
It can also generate charts, diagrams, or graphics to

00:03:19.686 --> 00:03:24.390
illustrate complex ideas. You can try a prompt like,

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:27.118
“Add a pie chart to represent the budget breakdown”

00:03:27.118 --> 00:03:30.730
to obtain complex data in a pleasing visual form.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.712
In collaboration-focused tools like

00:03:33.712 --> 00:03:37.720
Microsoft Teams, Copilot enhances communication

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:40.920
and project management. During meetings,

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.984
Copilot can transcribe discussions, generate action

00:03:43.984 --> 00:03:47.080
items, and even summarize meeting highlights

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.120
for absent team members.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.952
The Business Chat feature connects data across

00:03:51.952 --> 00:03:56.024
Microsoft 365 apps to enable advanced workflows.

00:03:56.024 --> 00:03:58.826
For example, you can ask, “Send a summary of

00:03:58.826 --> 00:04:01.650
today’s meeting to the sales team with key takeaways,”

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:05.722
and it pulls information from meeting notes, emails, and

00:04:05.722 --> 00:04:08.434
chat history to craft the message.

00:04:08.434 --> 00:04:10.610
Copilot integrates across apps,

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.322
enabling fluid transitions.

00:04:12.322 --> 00:04:15.850
For instance, data visualized in Excel can be

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.498
exported into a PowerPoint slide with a simple

00:04:18.498 --> 00:04:21.610
command like “Add this chart to my presentation.”

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.802
The seamless integration of Copilot across workplace

00:04:24.802 --> 00:04:27.640
tools ensures tasks that once required

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.552
multiple steps and tools are now completed

00:04:30.552 --> 00:04:32.400
effortlessly in one system.